SUBROUTINE omega_OF_C(T, C, P, KK, WDOT, DTDt)
IMPLICIT DOUBLE PRECISION (A-H, O-Z), INTEGER (I-N)
PARAMETER (EXPARG=690.776, SMALL=1.D-300)
DIMENSION Y(KK), C(KK), G0(KK), WDOT(*), CPML(KK), WT(KK), HML(KK)
DTdt = 0.d0
